  "scope_notes": [
    "Actual repository release for 2016-2020, local TCP and dedicated PostgreSQL; no production application code modified.",
    "Local Nginx uses one worker, keepalive 64 and shipped proxy timeouts; loopback HTTP, without production TLS/HTTP2.",
    "The Nginx bootstrap, cold raw reads and report phases were run after replacing the server with a clean process. The wrapper adds a local metrics route and counts CPU function calls; it preserves admission and scheduling.",
    "The 50-reader raw phase uses one account for read-only artifact requests. The login, session, regression and report phases use 50 distinct demo student accounts.",
    "The distinct-placebo phase varies the API seed at n_draws=40; the stock UI fixes the seed and is separately tested with identical parameters.",
    "The deterministic orphan probe bypasses HTTP to expose the in-process boundary; 200 requests is not a claim that Uvicorn admits 200 simultaneous HTTP requests.",
    "The screenshot records a real browser login timeout during an earlier mixed phase with abandoned placebo work plus raw reads. It is illustrative, not the clean raw phase measurement.",
    "The initial raw probe aborted on an uncaught HTTP timeout; it is excluded. The corrected raw probe catches errors, uses independent probe clients and ran on the clean server.",
    "All four seeded default regression results had status invalid_design; these are reportable diagnostic records. Report timings do not establish timings for every possible inferential result."
  ],
